      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Base rate/reference class: the same-calendar-month September reference class is the right base rate because MTS monthly flows are dominated by quarterly tax dates and benefit-payment timing. The 2019-2025 September sample has mean deficit 63.119 usd_billions and median deficit 61.544 usd_billions after converting surpluses to negative values."
